# Repo-root build context (services build from `.` so they can pip install
# sdk/prokura-telemetry). Keep the context lean — exclude everything a service
# image never needs so builds stay fast.
.git
.gitignore
docs
tests
spike
openspec
notes
*.md
**/README.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
**/.venv
.env
**/.env
node_modules
**/node_modules
# other services' local state / data dirs (each service copies only its own tree)
**/data
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db
